## brief --for reviewer, outside a session, with no hooks: its offer
If your session has no handoff hooks, offer to set them up for every project: `handoff settings claude --global` or `handoff settings codex --global` prints them and where they go. With the operator's OK, add them. They work once the operator starts this session again.
